'''Castle Drakan''' is the seat of power of [[Morytania]] and the stronghold from which [[Lowerniel Drakan]] rules the region. Following the events of [[The Blood Moon Rises]], it is claimed by [[Sugadinti Vitur]]. The castle was built as a replica of [[Vampyre Houses#House Drakan|House Drakan]]'s original castle on [[Vampyrium]], which is explored during [[The Blood Moon Rises]].

The walls surrounding the castle are frequented by players who are directed there via [[Clue scroll (master)|master emote clues]].

==Quests==
In the quest [[Darkness of Hallowvale]], the player must assist [[Safalaan Hallow]], the leader of Meiyerditch division of [[The Myreque]], in drawing the castle from the north, west and south. While on the walls the player witnesses [[Vanstrom Klause]] speaking to [[Lord Drakan]]'s relatives and a [[Vampyre juvinate]] in the castle's garden.

In [[Sins of the Father]], [[Vanescula Drakan]] leads the remaining members of the Myreque, whom she has allied with, into the courtyard of the usually inaccessible castle to face and kill Lord Drakan. Lord Drakan appears on the main staircase and descends it to confront his sister. He quickly subdues Vanescula and incinerates most of the Myreque, before returning to the castle with his unconscious sister, and leave [[Vanstrom Klause]] to deal with the few remaining survivors, the [[player]], [[Safalaan]], [[Ivan Strom]] and [[Veliaf Hurtz]], although the player ends up having to defeat Vanstrom alone in the courtyard. After Vanstrom's defeat Ivan manages to teleport himself, the player and Veliaf out as the [[vampyre sentinel]]s start to swoop in, but they have to abandon Safalaan.

Throughout [[The Blood Moon Rises]], players revisit the courtyard multiple times, sneak into Castle Drakan via a secret tunnel with Ivan and Veliaf, and explore the interiors of both the [[Gielinor]] and [[Vampyrium]] castles. Access to the Gielinor castle is limited to the main entry hall and basement. During the events of The Blood Moon Rises, the Vampyrium castle is explored extensively through a series of puzzles. The final fight against [[Lowerniel Drakan]] occurs on the roof of the Vampyrium castle. After the quest, the interior of the Vampyrium castle becomes inaccessible, while the Gielinor castle is permanently accessible (with the exception of its courtyard), with [[Sugadinti Vitur]], [[Efaritay Hallow]], and [[Vanescula Drakan]] found inside, along with a portal to [[Vampyrium]].

